Since April, people have told us their bookings land on the wrong day: a month flipped. By
4 October the desk had **412 reports**.

**Split into three problems.** Reading the report bodies showed this ticket holds three
different defects, not one. See [what it shows](/kb/incidents/4471-what-it-shows) for the
full analysis. Individual tickets: parser-order (379 reports), hint-mismatch (33), one-day-move (5).

<Callout>
